{"id":"u-a45e8e28-411d-48d6-9d23-21d312c720b5","src":"community","title":"Full Body Strength Training","author":"Mark L.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Gvua3n-vive12weekboostcampsimpleimport","desc":"This 12-week program is designed for lifters returning to strength training who want structured, varied full-body workouts without spending every day in the gym.\n\nTraining is scheduled three days per week, with each week covering all major muscle groups through a balanced mix of barbells, dumbbells, cables and machines. The program emphasizes strength, general fitness, muscle retention and support for fat loss, while keeping most sessions within approximately 45–60 minutes including warm-up and cooldown.\n\nRather than repeating the exact same workout every week, the program uses planned exercise variations, rep-range changes and progressive loading to keep training fresh while still allowing measurable improvement. Deload weeks are included to manage fatigue, reinforce technique and prepare for heavier training blocks.\n\nThis program is best suited to beginner-to-intermediate lifters, especially those returning after time away, who are comfortable using standard gym equipment and prefer resistance training over bodyweight-focused workouts. No sets are intended to be taken to failure, and all major lifts use controlled effort targets to encourage safe, sustainable progress.","level":["Beginner","Novice"],"goals":["Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-08-11T20:38:39.010Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Foundation A — Squat & Press","Foundation B — Hinge & Upper","Foundation C — Deadlift & Machine Push"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":3}],"note":"Controlled depth; leave 4 reps in reserve."},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":6,"x":3}],"note":"Neutral or comfortable grip."},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":6,"x":3}],"note":"